（第1天至第12周）；安全性随访期（末次给药后28天）","quote_sha256":"5f70702e39cadf179a52e4bdcc650c476a9afa7dee7da140adcc51db4fa0c973","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_007"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"访视策略：筛选（V1，-28~-1天）、基线随机（V2，D1）、第2/4/8/12周门诊访视（V3–V6）、治疗结束访视（V7，W12）、末次给药后28天安全性随访（V8）","quote_sha256":"a95657905fe8c43374679878ee0819c2e7188463cfd0db3b86667728b2df24d2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_008"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"SGC-R23片 2.5mg/5mg/10mg（剂量组按随机分配），口服每日一次×12周","quote_sha256":"b6632f8d28f64c7693c8dc2a200924eb4f3c9d23161fa0b7b978b50eee70b131","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_009"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"无确证性假设检验","quote_sha256":"e926c8d361a08296673bf2d42bc6379d235cf1feb2f48979a4bfa55d107470a6","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_010"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"估计目标：12周NT-proBNP较基线百分比变化；人群为随机化全分析集；伴发事件按治疗方针策略处理；汇总统计量为各组均值差","quote_sha256":"66361c3b18595dbbcc83d69ba26eeedc57c815d7f61553a19cda5e7c9bd182ce","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_011"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"主要分析集为FAS；主要终点采用ANCOVA（基线log NT-proBNP为协变量）比较各剂量组与安慰剂组第12周变化，报告几何均值比与90%CI；安全性按SAS描述","quote_sha256":"b458974c5327188f93b228806b503514c35e4c65db5922ecff8da74e9a196c43","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_012"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"探索性样本量：按NT-proBNP对数尺度组间SD约0.35估计，每组约40例（共160例）可在双侧α=0.10下提供约80%把握检测组间差异；含约10%脱落补偿","quote_sha256":"1a9cf65ad4eef237b1d491df15b91caf6bb919a314005e20f1972876bd1ccac1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_013"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"试验组与对照组：SGC-R23低剂量组；SGC-R23中剂量组；SGC-R23高剂量组；安慰剂对照组","quote_sha256":"dab866f417c0496f82b817f6b9d35ae393fc0cc0cbf5cc69078b4cf60e3f5a54","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_016"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"安慰剂平行对照：安慰剂片外观与SGC-R23一致，口服每日一次×12周","quote_sha256":"eb245f6ec78077bb9fb6868d205ae8ae4032141b35f44617aad1c27587cb86e3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_017"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"剂量递增与安全性暂停规则按方案剂量递增章节执行","quote_sha256":"982cc39d83b43348482ba77dcfd4ce392d89750f5b67ed11704d8bd47fa99b32","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_018"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_004","es_006","es_007","es_008","es_009","es_010","es_011","es_012","es_013","es_016","es_017","es_018"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":12},"gap_items":[],"heading":"研究设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照的II期概念验证与剂量探索研究，在中国开展。研究采用平行组设计，设SGC-R23低剂量组（2.5mg）、中剂量组（5mg）、高剂量组（10mg）及安慰剂对照组，共四个治疗组，各组按1:1:1:1比例随机分配。所有受试者在随机化前已接受稳定剂量指南导向药物治疗（GDMT）至少4周，研究期间背景GDMT按指南维持稳定。\n\nSGC-R23以薄膜衣片形式口服给药，每日一次，连续给药12周；安慰剂片外观与SGC-R23一致，同样口服每日一次、连续12周。剂量递增与安全性暂停规则按方案剂量递增章节执行。\n\n研究时期分为三个阶段：筛选期（第-28天至第-1天）、治疗期（第1天至第12周）及安全性随访期（末次给药后28天）。访视安排为：筛选访视（V1，第-28至-1天）、基线随机访视（V2，第1天）、第2/4/8/12周门诊访视（V3至V6）、治疗结束访视（V7，第12周）及末次给药后28天安全性随访访视（V8）。\n\n本研究不计划自适应设计、样本量再估计、期中分析、SRC或DMC。样本量为探索性估算：按NT-proBNP对数尺度组间标准差约0.35估计，每组约40例（共160例），含约10%脱落补偿，可在双侧α=0.10下提供约80%把握度检测组间差异。主要分析集为全分析集（FAS），主要终点采用ANCOVA（基线log NT-proBNP为协变量）比较各剂量组与安慰剂组第12周变化，报告几何均值比与90%置信区间；安全性按安全性分析集（SAS）描述；本研究无确证性假设检验。\n\n估计目标策略：估计目标为第12周NT-proBNP较基线百分比变化，目标人群为随机化全分析集，伴发事件按治疗方针策略处理，汇总统计量为各组均值差。","rationale":"研究设计全部要素（多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照、II期、PoC与剂量探索、四组1:1:1:1、剂量2.5/5/10mg、口服每日一次×12周、研究时期、访视策略、样本量、统计方法、估计目标策略、无自适应/期中/DMC等）均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。安慰剂外观与SGC-R23一致、背景GDMT维持稳定亦为已确认事实。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（α、主要终点、估计目标、伴发事件、期中分析、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9eb82f07945e_3643f68e3aa2dd22","section_number":"4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:c109a85ec072867ccd2d7e40","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:46d82ed9e2e3ef","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3809927f2ae07b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261003140536_5c5c24d8","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_9eb82f07945e_787e4e3b7172115a:full-draft:c109a85ec072867ccd2d7e40","quote":"随机化；双盲；安慰剂对照；平行组；多中心","quote_sha256":"2390eec78cb63fbb744f4d0cd34ca9e3a52cae7420fe7f7e88f4c2d12a283514","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:c109a85ec072867ccd2d7e40","span_id":"es_005"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照的II期概念验证与剂量探索研究：SGC-R23设低/中/高三个剂量组与安慰剂组平行对照","quote_sha256":"21b3be162616b614ebce50b36ca3af3680510681653e517387a59be33ffd3aaf","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_004"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"各组按1:1:1:1随机；背景GDMT按指南维持稳定","quote_sha256":"e6b14ac83200c45a655f0ddd62d977b3c4964ac50e58cdfb97023bc815de16be","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_006"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"SGC-R23片 2.5mg/5mg/10mg（剂量组按随机分配），口服每日一次×12周","quote_sha256":"b6632f8d28f64c7693c8dc2a200924eb4f3c9d23161fa0b7b978b50eee70b131","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_009"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"试验组与对照组：SGC-R23低剂量组；SGC-R23中剂量组；SGC-R23高剂量组；安慰剂对照组","quote_sha256":"dab866f417c0496f82b817f6b9d35ae393fc0cc0cbf5cc69078b4cf60e3f5a54","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_016"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:revision:4","quote":"安慰剂平行对照：安慰剂片外观与SGC-R23一致，口服每日一次×12周","quote_sha256":"eb245f6ec78077bb9fb6868d205ae8ae4032141b35f44617aad1c27587cb86e3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_8010953a825e637fb9d3:r4:0225054d6df249e0","span_id":"es_017"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_005","es_004","es_006","es_009","es_016","es_017"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[],"heading":"总体设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究采用随机化、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心设计。受试者按1:1:1:1比例随机分配至SGC-R23低剂量组（2.5mg）、中剂量组（5mg）、高剂量组（10mg）或安慰剂对照组。SGC-R23与安慰剂均为口服薄膜衣片，外观一致，每日一次给药，连续12周。研究在中国多中心开展，不设自适应设计、样本量再估计、期中分析、SRC或DMC。","rationale":"双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心、随机化等设计要素来源于章节包已确认内容；1:1:1:1分配、四组设置、剂量、口服每日一次×12周、无自适应/期中/DMC等来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（总体设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（期中分析、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本